{"1222040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Offroad Mania", "steam_appid": 1222040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Free updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/117a7784c2da151c47411c3fd2b21127.avif?t=1727955262\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Offroad Mania</strong> — off-road 4x4 driving simulator based on realistic car physics. Regularly free updates!<br><strong>Modes:</strong> Classic (240 levels), Free Roam, Racing, Endless, Winter (rocks, mud, snow, water, logs, trees, bridges, ramps). <br><strong>Vehicles:</strong> 10+ amazing 4×4 cars for your driving fun. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/fdb93a18e238dc7770b2be3bdef36567.avif?t=1727955262\" width=570 height=116 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/e5125f064a210ec41a19ffb3bb96a3aa.avif?t=1727955262\" width=570 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSIC MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/5a0d13830a60e21dd5785ae9e15eeba7.poster.avif?t=1727955262\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/5a0d13830a60e21dd5785ae9e15eeba7.webm?t=1727955262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/6b9da26b72c99731e124a3b389ae1166.poster.avif?t=1727955262\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/6b9da26b72c99731e124a3b389ae1166.webm?t=1727955262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Description:</strong><br>Classic trial on special levels. All levels have a start and a finish line with 3 trophies to grab. No time limit.<br><br><strong>Sub-modes:</strong><br><u>Hard mode</u> - get all trophies in one attempt (or quickly restart with the new GUI).<br><u>Cockpit mode</u> - complete all levels in cockpit view.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEROAM MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/6b82d93511a1c4a083fcc15df840dcc3.poster.avif?t=1727955262\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/6b82d93511a1c4a083fcc15df840dcc3.webm?t=1727955262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Description:</strong><br>Free ride without limitation. No start/finish and no trophies. No time limit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACING MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/45225b32ed5954c2451bdb9a20d064b7.poster.avif?t=1727955262\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/45225b32ed5954c2451bdb9a20d064b7.webm?t=1727955262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Description:</strong><br>Race tracks with a timer. There is a start/finish line and a global time-leaderboard. No trophies to grab while racing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_i