e. No time limit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURED</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic (240 levels) + Free roam + Racing + Endless + Winter (rocks, mud, snow, water, logs, trees, bridges, ramps)<br></li><li> 10+ amazing 4×4 off road cars (different suspension and chassis setups as well as distinct engine sounds)<br></li><li> Car physics based game<br></li><li> Car and driver customization<br></li><li> Fun driving gameplay<br></li><li> Flat graphics (colorful, clean and HARDWARE FRIENDLY)<br></li><li> Gamepad support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE UPDATES</h2>We regularly improve the game with you (write your ideas in our Community Hub and Discord channel).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO OFF ROAD! GO HAVE FUN!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/013aa5c19ecd37fc5bbce58aca1d2d7e.avif?t=1727955262\" width=616 height=210 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Offroad Mania</strong> — off-road 4x4 driving simulator based on realistic car physics. Regularly free updates!<br><strong>Modes:</strong> Classic (240 levels), Free Roam, Racing, Endless, Winter (rocks, mud, snow, water, logs, trees, bridges, ramps). <br><strong>Vehicles:</strong> 10+ amazing 4×4 cars for your driving fun. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/fdb93a18e238dc7770b2be3bdef36567.avif?t=1727955262\" width=570 height=116 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/e5125f064a210ec41a19ffb3bb96a3aa.avif?t=1727955262\" width=570 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSIC MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222040/extras/5a0d13830a60e2